WEBVTT

00:09:57.825 --> 00:10:00.771
ako nastavite da čitate prva slova nadole,

00:10:00.771 --> 00:10:03.572
dobićete kobaltno plavog konja,

00:10:03.572 --> 00:10:07.060
sovu boje ćilibara, srebrnog vola,

00:10:07.060 --> 00:10:10.558
crvenog magarca
i smaragdno zelenog petla.

00:10:10.558 --> 00:10:12.164
(Aplauz)

00:10:12.164 --> 00:10:15.441
To je baš kul, zar ne?

00:10:17.735 --> 00:10:19.446
To je Njujork tajms.

00:10:19.446 --> 00:10:21.022
Ali čekajte, čekajte. Čekajte.

00:10:21.022 --> 00:10:22.544
Oh, Gven,

00:10:22.544 --> 00:10:24.087
sećaš li se da sam zaboravio

00:10:24.087 --> 00:10:25.210
ljubičasti marker,

00:10:25.210 --> 00:10:28.165
i nisi mogla da obojiš ovcu?

00:10:28.165 --> 00:10:29.648
Pa, ako nastaviš da čitaš

00:10:29.648 --> 00:10:31.279
počevši od 25 na dole,